<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="498577461"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537906566"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="永遠"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="EGOIST"/><amll:meta key="album" value="英雄　運命の詩"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:14.707"><div begin="00:27.514" end="04:08.000"><p begin="00:27.514" end="00:33.587" itunes:key="L10089">懐かし空 雲は流れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人怀念的天空 云在飘动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ka shi so ra ku mo wa na ga re</span></p><p begin="00:33.597" end="00:39.577" itunes:key="L10090">遠ざかってく想いの行方<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远去的思绪 去往何方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o za ka 't te ku o mo i no yu ku e</span></p><p begin="00:39.587" end="00:43.837" itunes:key="L10091">夕が暮れ帳落ちる夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳渐斜 夜幕降临</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ga ku re to ba ri o chi ru yo ru</span></p><p begin="00:43.847" end="00:50.881" itunes:key="L10143">幾億の星 落ちてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不计其数的繁星陨落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku o ku no ho shi o chi te ku</span></p><p begin="00:50.891" end="00:57.569" itunes:key="L10092">帰りし夢の終まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到归途中 梦的终点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ri shi yu me no tsu i ma de</span></p><p begin="00:57.579" end="01:04.156" itunes:key="L10093">会いに来て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前来相见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ni ki te</span></p><p begin="01:04.166" end="01:05.648" itunes:key="L10094">この手は強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te wa tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="01:05.658" end="01:07.255" itunes:key="L10095">強く握るわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku ni gi ru wa</span></p><p begin="01:07.265" end="01:10.180" itunes:key="L10096">あなたはそこにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果感觉你在那里感受到的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa so ko ni i te</span></p><p begin="01:10.190" end="01:13.372" itunes:key="L10097">感じるのなら応えてほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你能有所回应</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji ru no na ra ko ta e te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="01:13.382" end="01:16.252" itunes:key="L10098">重ねてみて ああ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反复尝试 啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka sa ne te mi te a a</span></p><p begin="01:16.262" end="01:19.428" itunes:key="L10099">誰のものなら許されるという<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果是谁的话 可以被原谅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re no mo no na ra yu ru sa re ru to i u</span></p><p begin="01:19.438" end="01:22.363" itunes:key="L10100">明日の私を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抛弃明天的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta no wa ta shi wo</span></p><p begin="01:22.373" end="01:25.551" itunes:key="L10101">見捨てるとして愛してほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在消失之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi su te ru to shi te a i shi te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="01:25.561" end="01:28.250" itunes:key="L10102">消えてしまう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te shi ma u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:28.260" end="01:34.321" itunes:key="L10103">雨音跳ねて風匂う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨声飞溅 风香阵阵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma o to ha ne te ka ze ni o u</span></p><p begin="01:34.331" end="01:40.369" itunes:key="L10104">閉じこもった心憂う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧闭的内心 忧伤哀叹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ji ko mo 't ta ko ko ro u re u</span></p><p begin="01:40.379" end="01:48.578" itunes:key="L10105">十が揺れ垂る川面に映る連理の影<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风雨飘摇的河面上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ga yu re shi da ru ka wa mo ni</span></p><p begin="01:48.588" end="01:51.608" itunes:key="L10148">波打ち</p><p begin="01:51.618" end="01:58.288" itunes:key="L10106">朝には夢をなびく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早晨 遵从自己的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa ni wa yu me wo na bi ku</span></p><p begin="01:58.298" end="02:04.924" itunes:key="L10107">嬉しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜不自胜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u re shi ku te</span></p><p begin="02:04.934" end="02:06.332" itunes:key="L10108">痛みは強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剧烈的疼痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mi wa tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="02:06.342" end="02:08.135" itunes:key="L10109">強く揺らすわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">强烈地摇晃着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku yu ra su wa</span></p><p begin="02:08.145" end="02:11.003" itunes:key="L10110">私を抱く身体<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的身体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wo da ku ka ra da</span></p><p begin="02:11.013" end="02:14.097" itunes:key="L10111">感じるのなら応えてほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果感觉到的话 希望你能有所回应</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji ru no na ra ko ta e te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="02:14.107" end="02:17.003" itunes:key="L10112">重ねてみて ああ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反复尝试</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka sa ne te mi te a a</span></p><p begin="02:17.013" end="02:20.185" itunes:key="L10113">忘れられないくらいにしてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以忘怀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ra re na i ku ra i ni shi te yo</span></p><p begin="02:20.195" end="02:23.057" itunes:key="L10114">あなたを描くから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘着你的样子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wo e ga ku ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:23.067" end="02:26.319" itunes:key="L10115">悲しむのなら笑ってほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你如果感到悲伤的话 就笑一下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi mu no na ra wa ra 't te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="02:26.329" end="02:29.062" itunes:key="L10116">気づいてしまう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在觉察到之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu i te shi ma u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="02:29.072" end="02:32.036" itunes:key="L10117">触れた手は冷たくて知った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">碰触的手 渐渐变冷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta te wa tsu me ta ku te shi 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:32.046" end="02:35.146" itunes:key="L10118">白くなる 忘れじの想い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思念如霜般雪白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ro ku na ru wa su re ji no o mo i</span></p><p begin="02:35.156" end="02:38.151" itunes:key="L10119">零れてく 想いが落ちてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">零落的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re te ku o mo i ga o chi te ku</span></p><p begin="02:38.161" end="02:41.166" itunes:key="L10120">どこまでも どこまでも遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去向哪里 去向哪里 远方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo do ko ma de mo to o ku</span></p><p begin="02:41.176" end="02:44.219" itunes:key="L10121">触れた手は冷たくて知った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">碰触的手 渐渐变冷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta te wa tsu me ta ku te shi 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:44.229" end="02:47.233" itunes:key="L10122">白くして 吐息ごと溢れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连同雪白的气息都溢出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ro ku shi te to i ki go to a fu re</span></p><p begin="02:47.243" end="02:50.224" itunes:key="L10123">零れたら 想いが落ちてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">零落的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re ta ra o mo i ga o chi te ku</span></p><p begin="02:50.234" end="02:52.976" itunes:key="L10124">永遠のさよならをするわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛永远的别离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e i e n no sa yo na ra wo su ru wa</span></p><p begin="02:52.986" end="03:04.857" itunes:key="L10125">桜が舞い散る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">樱花飘落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ku ra ga ma i chi ru</span></p><p begin="03:05.029" end="03:17.289" itunes:key="L10144">この目に映った<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no me ni u tsu 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:19.323" end="03:20.804" itunes:key="L10126">この手は強く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no te wa tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="03:20.814" end="03:22.368" itunes:key="L10127">強く握るわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku ni gi ru wa</span></p><p begin="03:22.378" end="03:25.373" itunes:key="L10128">あなたはそこにいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你在那里感受到的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa so ko ni i te</span></p><p begin="03:25.383" end="03:28.526" itunes:key="L10129">感じるのなら応えてほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你有所回应</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji ru no na ra ko ta e te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="03:28.536" end="03:31.427" itunes:key="L10130">重ねてみて ああ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反复尝试</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka sa ne te mi te a a</span></p><p begin="03:31.437" end="03:34.584" itunes:key="L10131">生まれたことに意味を与えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赋予生命意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ta ko to ni i mi wo a ta e te</span></p><p begin="03:34.594" end="03:37.494" itunes:key="L10132">今この私を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ko no wa ta shi wo</span></p><p begin="03:37.504" end="03:40.593" itunes:key="L10133">最後の時と愛してほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在最后的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no to ki to a i shi te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="03:40.603" end="03:43.480" itunes:key="L10134">消えてしまう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在消失之前 想要爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te shi ma u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="03:43.490" end="03:45.084" itunes:key="L10135">目を閉じて そう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me wo to ji te</span></p><p begin="03:45.094" end="03:46.674" itunes:key="L10145">ゆっくりでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">慢慢地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u yu 'k ku ri de i i</span></p><p begin="03:46.684" end="03:49.640" itunes:key="L10136">少しずつ忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi zu tsu wa su re te</span></p><p begin="03:49.650" end="03:52.859" itunes:key="L10137">思い出すのもしなくなるでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回忆也渐渐消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da su no mo shi na ku na ru de sho u</span></p><p begin="03:52.869" end="03:55.243" itunes:key="L10138">口づけして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连口头禅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku chi zu ke shi te</span></p><p begin="03:55.779" end="03:57.276" itunes:key="L10139">いつかなどない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知什么时候也没有了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka na do na i</span></p><p begin="03:57.286" end="03:58.818" itunes:key="L10146">だから今して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 现在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra i ma shi te</span></p><p begin="03:58.828" end="04:01.823" itunes:key="L10140">あなたを選ぶから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我选择了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wo e ra bu ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:01.833" end="04:03.282" itunes:key="L10141">言葉はいらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不需要语言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba wa i ra na i</span></p><p begin="04:03.292" end="04:04.962" itunes:key="L10147">あなたに残す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留给你的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni no ko su</span></p><p begin="04:04.972" end="04:08.000" itunes:key="L10142">私の傷跡<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no ki zu a to</span></p></div></body></tt>